  <h4>Workplace safety for all businesses.</h4>
  
    <div class="blog-cta-text">
      <p>SafeDE provides FREE comprehensive onsite surveys for small and medium sized private sector establishments to identify potential workplace hazards, improve safety and health management systems, and assist in voluntary compliance with federal OSHA regulations.</p>
